[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2906978479","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106762#issuecomment-2906978479","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106762","id":2906978479,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tRPiv","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-24T19:01:01Z","updated_at":"2025-05-24T19:04:37Z","body":"Thanks for the tips! I changed the width to a constant, and removed the `dock_margin` variable because it was only used to keep track of the border width. I draw the highlight outside of the rect for it to not be obscured by the TabBar (I can't change the z-index of the TabBar because the tabbar background would draw over them), so it is slightly smaller on the edge of the window in the compact mode.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2906978479/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2914393245","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106762#issuecomment-2914393245","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106762","id":2914393245,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tthyd","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-27T23:05:25Z","updated_at":"2025-05-27T23:05:25Z","body":"Thanks for the tip on `call_deferred()`, that was really bugging me. I incorporated the rest of your suggestions into the code, and got rid of the unnecessary `EditorDockTabContainer` mentions.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2914393245/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2914604188","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106762#issuecomment-2914604188","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106762","id":2914604188,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tuVSc","user":{"login":"kitbdev","id":10054226,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMDU0MjI2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10054226?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev","html_url":"https://github.com/kitbdev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kitbdev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-28T01:25:53Z","updated_at":"2025-05-28T01:35:33Z","body":"The `drop_data` and other methods are intended to only be called from the Viewport, this is fighting with the drag and drop system, as can be seen with the cursor workaround.\r\nI was imagining dynamically creating new Controls that cover the TabContainer's contents on drag start, this way we can have more drop targets than just in the TabContainers (eg. to move to dock slots with no tabs), the contents wouldn't receive their own can_drop, and it would work with the drag and drop system better. \r\nThough I'm not sure if there are any problems with that approach, and I wanted to get a better idea of how floating docks could support it before trying it.\r\n- Edit: It would probably also fix https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/93755. Or maybe not, since it just happens on process.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2914604188/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":1},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2914612833","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106762#issuecomment-2914612833","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106762","id":2914612833,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tuXZh","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-28T01:32:15Z","updated_at":"2025-05-28T01:48:29Z","body":"Thats a good idea, I'll play around with it. I think that floating docks right now are more about docks themselves rather than the TabContainers though, so I don't know if they should be supported.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2914612833/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2915925541","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/106762#issuecomment-2915925541","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106762","id":2915925541,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6tzX4l","user":{"login":"lodetrick","id":146759331,"node_id":"U_kgDOCL9eow","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/146759331?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick","html_url":"https://github.com/lodetrick","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lodetrick/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-28T11:14:42Z","updated_at":"2025-05-28T16:49:58Z","body":"Ok, I tried to create floating controls that would allow users to place docks in hidden TabContainers. The code for deciding on the rects was rather large. I am aware that when the bottom right dock slot of the left or right is unfilled it does look a bit weird. I'm curious what others think about this:\r\n\r\n<img width=\"276\" alt=\"Screenshot 2025-05-28 at 4 11 30 AM\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e39667b6-8b0b-4d9c-892e-9d34dad04a6b\" />\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2915925541/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0